# Redirects to a page of this site belong in the front matter of that page: add the old URL
# to its `aliases`, after the page's own URL. The theme turns every alias but the first into
# a 301 redirect.
#
# Use this file for redirects that aliases cannot express, such as a redirect to another site:
# RewriteRule ^example-page/?$ https://example.com [L,R=301]
